{
  "id": "opening_arrival",
  "title": "初到红叶镇",
  "priority": 100,
  "trigger": {
    "hook": "all_of",
    "params": {
      "conditions": [
        {
          "hook": "cue",
          "params": {
            "cue": "view:dashboard"
          }
        },
        {
          "hook": "none_of",
          "params": {
            "conditions": [
              {
                "hook": "owns_partner",
                "params": {
                  "partner_id": "fein"
                }
              }
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  },
  "rewards": {
    "items": [
      {
        "item_id": "orange_berry_seed",
        "quantity": 1
      }
    ],
    "partner_ids": [
      "fein"
    ]
  },
  "steps": [
    {
      "type": "background",
      "asset_id": "portal_hollow"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "",
      "text": "你醒来的时候，天已经快黑了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "",
      "text": "陌生的天空，陌生的山。"
    },
    {
      "type": "portrait",
      "slot": "left",
      "asset_id": "fein_story"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "",
      "text": "还有一个蹲在你旁边的陌生女孩。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "？？？",
      "text": "醒了？",
      "focus": "left"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "？？？",
      "text": "先别动，我确认一下。",
      "focus": "left"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "",
      "text": "她伸出两根手指，在你眼前晃了晃。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "？？？",
      "text": "几根？",
      "focus": "left"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "你",
      "text": "……两根。",
      "focus": "right"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "？？？",
      "text": "很好，是活的。",
      "focus": "left"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "你",
      "text": "本来就是。",
      "focus": "right"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "？？？",
      "text": "那可不一定。上次从那边掉出来的是一只鞋。",
      "focus": "left"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "",
      "text": "她朝身后指了指。那里的空气裂着一道口子，正在慢慢合上。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "绯恩",
      "text": "这里是红叶镇。我叫绯恩，镇上的向导。",
      "focus": "left"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "绯恩",
      "text": "你呢？",
      "focus": "left"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "",
      "text": "你张了张嘴。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "",
      "text": "……想不起来。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "绯恩",
      "text": "名字也不记得？",
      "focus": "left"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "",
      "text": "你摇头。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "绯恩",
      "text": "家呢？",
      "focus": "left"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "",
      "text": "你继续摇头。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "",
      "text": "绯恩安静了几秒。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "绯恩",
      "text": "那就先别想了。",
      "focus": "left"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "绯恩",
      "text": "天要黑了，总不能让你睡在这里。",
      "focus": "left"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "",
      "text": "她站起来，向你伸出手。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "",
      "text": "你握住那只手，被她拉了起来。"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "asset_id": "town_gate_dusk"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "",
      "text": "山路的尽头是一片屋顶，还有几缕炊烟。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "绯恩",
      "text": "对了，问你个事。",
      "focus": "left"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "绯恩",
      "text": "会种田吗？",
      "focus": "left"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "你",
      "text": "……不知道。",
      "focus": "right"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "绯恩",
      "text": "很好。",
      "focus": "left"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "你",
      "text": "哪里好了？",
      "focus": "right"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "绯恩",
      "text": "你没说不会。",
      "focus": "left"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "",
      "text": "她的脚步好像快了一点。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "绯恩",
      "text": "正好，镇上有间空屋。",
      "focus": "left"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "你",
      "text": "真的？",
      "focus": "right"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "绯恩",
      "text": "真的。",
      "focus": "left"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "绯恩",
      "text": "还有一片田。",
      "focus": "left"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "你",
      "text": "……",
      "focus": "right"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "绯恩",
      "text": "还有全套农具。",
      "focus": "left"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "",
      "text": "绯恩露出了一个很自然的笑容。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "绯恩",
      "text": "你运气不错。",
      "focus": "left"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "",
      "text": "不知道为什么，你觉得这句话不太可信。"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "asset_id": "farm_house_night"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "",
      "text": "屋子比想象中干净。桌上点着一盏灯，灯边靠着一把锄头。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "你",
      "text": "为什么入住还要给我锄头？",
      "focus": "right"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "绯恩",
      "text": "镇上原来管农业的人，上个月不干了。",
      "focus": "left"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "你",
      "text": "为什么不干了？",
      "focus": "right"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "绯恩",
      "text": "他说他想去看海。",
      "focus": "left"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "绯恩",
      "text": "所以这份工作现在空着。",
      "focus": "left"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "你",
      "text": "你从山上就在打这个主意了吧。",
      "focus": "right"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "绯恩",
      "text": "从看到你还有气的时候就开始了。",
      "focus": "left"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "",
      "text": "她把锄头塞进你手里，又想了想。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "绯恩",
      "text": "不过说真的。",
      "focus": "left"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "绯恩",
      "text": "想不起来也没关系。种地一般用不到记忆。",
      "focus": "left"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "",
      "text": "她说这句话的时候没有笑。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "绯恩",
      "text": "明天早上我来找你。先睡吧。",
      "focus": "left"
    },
    {
      "type": "portrait",
      "slot": "left",
      "visible": false
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "",
      "text": "门关上了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "",
      "text": "窗外是完全陌生的星空。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "",
      "text": "但至少今晚，你有地方睡。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "",
      "text": "【伙伴「绯恩」加入了你的队伍】"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "",
      "text": "【获得「橙橙果种子」×1】"
    }
  ]
}
